 " into it."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->256,ExpressionUUID->"423deff3-98a1-4064-8537-b0c072ec983e"],

Cell["\<\
Instantiate[sol] clears sol, sets it to an association over the 18 object \
types, and installs the UpValues of Load, Unload, IncludeTo, DropFrom and \
MergeWith on it.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->257,ExpressionUUID->"85e5028a-4a2b-485f-8d13-97a3ea7bd065"],

Cell["\<\
A bare association, such as one returned by GetData, carries no UpValues and \
is inert. Load[sol] installs them; Instantiate is the way to start from \
nothing instead.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->258,ExpressionUUID->"dca48ac2-8997-4bda-976c-22f31d934dd1"],

Cell["\<\
Instantiate[sol, assoc] instantiates and then merges assoc in, which is \
equivalent to Instantiate followed by MergeWith.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->259,ExpressionUUID->"98f6b19c-5c79-4cb4-b81b-f3973b0b7e4f"],

Cell["Instantiate has the attribute HoldFirst.", "Notes",
 CellID->260,ExpressionUUID->"13bdf787-ff68-4687-be58-808ea0298843"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection",
 CellTags->"PrimaryExamplesSection",
 CellID->261,ExpressionUUID->"59186022-12c4-4561-9022-984b2b3685c7"],

Cell["Basic Examples", "ExampleSection",
 CellID->262,ExpressionUUID->"5e47d7ac-07a3-4e18-b342-8290042ad606"],

Cell["\<\
Before Instantiate, sol is an ordinary symbol: it has no value, and nothing \
is attached to it.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->263,ExpressionUUID->"f692b0f9-1f39-4399-b178-22a1abb6f2fa"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[", "sol", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"UpValues", "[", "sol", "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->264,ExpressionUUID->"8241ac6d-7f3f-4de4-9d7f-5cb8a68a051d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"False", ",", 
   RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->265,ExpressionUUID->"0a0540a4-619c-4ffb-b4f6-64edf00d407b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Instantiate makes it a solution. It returns nothing; the effect is on sol \
itself.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->266,ExpressionUUID->"93d64bf6-4c0c-4488-b3ef-98ea7ceb880d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Instantiate", "[", "sol", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->267,ExpressionUUID->"5a32d6ff-2490-4b66-b0fa-70d58997fc38"],

Cell["\<\
sol is now an association keyed by the eighteen object types, every one of \
them still empty. This is the container that IncludeTo fills.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->268,ExpressionUUID->"5d2aec79-e0e0-4223-ac60-2629ceb14b44"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData["sol"], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->269,ExpressionUUID->"ac43e33b-30c0-4bff-aa85-3fb4f49f10dc"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"$manifold", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$parameter", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$metric", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$frame", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$spinStructure", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$spinConnection", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$bundle", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$covd", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$chart", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$basis", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$form", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$tensor", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$spinor", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$function", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$constant", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$assumption", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$rule", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"$set", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", "\[RightAssociation]"}]}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->270,ExpressionUUID->"28cd2809-7e86-4223-83e3-96072392dcdf"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
It has also acquired UpValues, so the solution functions now act on it \
directly. These are the functions hooked onto sol:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->271,ExpressionUUID->"41f39542-dbbc-42e3-8c80-24807351ad7c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Union", "@", 
  RowBox[{"Cases", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"UpValues", "[", "sol", "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Verbatim", "[", "HoldPattern", "]"}], "[", 
      RowBox[{"f_Symbol", "[", "___", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ":>", " ", "f"}], 
    ",", " ", "Infinity"}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->272,ExpressionUUID->"55b34e81-e71d-4289-bcd2-7042bf5e52a3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
  "DropFrom", ",", "IncludeTo", ",", "Load", ",", "MergeWith", ",", 
   "Unload"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->273,ExpressionUUID->"8ea9d337-0e60-4cdb-8b5d-6096c2ff2a60"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Eleven UpValue patterns implement those five functions -- one per argument \
form each accepts.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->274,ExpressionUUID->"d14a64fd-3c32-434e-a5a9-2499009e071d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
  RowBox[{"UpValues", "[", "sol", "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[ ]:=",
 CellID->275,ExpressionUUID->"fb6127e4-a787-4fb3-88f2-57880475bc24"],

Cell[BoxData["11"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]=",
 CellID->276,ExpressionUUID->"f1a0b526-9b11-4f03-ab8f-5074f49dc8cc"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

